{"heroId":88,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/baba_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/baba_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/baba_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"There are a few things most denizens of The Cursed Apple hope to experience at some point in their lives.\n\nSee a Broadway show.\nIce Skate at Rockefeller Center during Christmas season.\nGet yelled at by the Central Park Pigeon Lady.\n\nBecause Baba is more than just an old woman that feeds spirit pigeons in the park... she's an institution.  A force of nature woven into the very lore of New York City.  Is it true that she's sat at the same bench every day for the past 50 years, rain or shine?  Maybe.  Is she REALLY the leader of The Soho Coven?  Who's to say.  One thing's for sure though... she's a New Yorker.  And she's not going to sit back and watch a bunch of tourists tear apart Manhattan in pursuit of power.","tags":["Cackling","Beady","Hexing"]},"es":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"Hay algunas cosas que la mayoría de quienes habitan la Manzana Maldita esperan vivir en algún momento de su vida.\n\nVer un espectáculo de Broadway.\nPatinar sobre hielo en el Rockefeller Center durante las Navidades.\nRecibir una bronca a gritos de la señora de las palomas de Central Park.\n\nPorque Yagá es más que una simple anciana que da de comer a palomas espirituales en el parque... es toda una institución. Una fuerza de la naturaleza entretejida en la mismísima leyenda de Nueva York. ¿Es verdad que lleva 50 años sentándose a diario en el mismo banco, llueva o truene? Puede ser. ¿Es DE VERDAD la líder del Pacto de SoHo? Quién sabe, pero una cosa es segura: es neoyorquina y no se va a quedar de brazos cruzados viendo cómo una panda de turistas destroza Manhattan en busca de poder.","tags":["Carcajeante","Avizora","Hechicera"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":1282689113,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Threadsap","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/baba/threadsap.webp","quip":[{"t":"Threadsap"}],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Weave a scraggly thread that follows your crosshair before bursting along its path, dealing "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":" and stealing enemy "},{"t":"Spirit","attr":"Spirit","icon":"attr_Spirit"},{"t":", increased in effectiveness for Baba. While holding stolen "},{"t":"Spirit","attr":"Spirit","icon":"attr_Spirit"},{"t":", Baba deals "},{"t":"bonus spirit damage","attr":"BonusSpiritDamage","icon":"attr_BonusSpiritDamage"},{"t":" with every bullet."}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Spirit Stolen per Hit","value":"10","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/core/icon_spirit.svg"},{"label":"Stolen Spirit Effectiveness","value":"175","unit":"%"},{"label":"Spirit Damage Per Bullet","value":"8","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Debuff Duration","value":"22","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/duration.svg"},{"label":"Max Spirit Stolen","value":"45","unit":""},{"label":"Damage","value":"50","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"26","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/cooldown.svg"},"upgrades":[[{"t":"+8 Spirit Damage Per Bullet","hi":true}],[{"t":"-12s Cooldown +8s Debuff Duration"}],[{"t":"+1 Charge On Hit: Pull enemies 7m"}]]},{"id":3122124161,"slot":2,"ultimate":false,"name":"Granny Long Legs","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/baba/strafing_ru